      "content_html": "<img src=\"http://static.dezeen.com/uploads/2026/10/kevin-mccloud-sq-411x411.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\"/>\n<p>TV show Grand Designs is still going strong after 27 years. In this interview, the show's host, Kevin McCloud, considers how British architecture has changed over that time. First aired in 1999, Grand Designs follows the self-build projects of individuals and families creating their dream homes, through the highs as well as the lows. Having</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.dezeen.com/2026/10/08/residential-architecture-playful-kevin-mccloud-interviews/\">Residential architecture is getting more playful, says Kevin McCloud</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.dezeen.com\">Dezeen</a>.</p>",
